<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 416)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Kitsu-pulled clips stamped by the pipeline now label their gate with the camera's actual sensor mode — the outline reads <code>ALEXA LF OPEN GATE (3:2)</code>, exactly as the dailies tool named it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
